    <string name="sample_story">The night the stars rose, the boys sat behind the window. Uncle Reza did not know that this was the night of small secrets. The families of the town believed the largest treasures were hidden in lead boxes, but the young man knew the most valuable wealth was the kind words he kept for everyone. He gave his sister a perfect cake and said: “Every quick reply and every kind letter is a message you can compose when you hope.” The morning came and the people walked to the park; each one made a simple joke and the story of the amazing day of our team became famous all over the town.</string>
